      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max has brought Nastya and Kostya to Vika's flat as a birthday surprise, and it is a mistake. Vika expected a quiet evening for two, and Nastya was told that Vika wouldn't be there. Listen to it fall apart in Russian first.",
